{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54062","headline":"留壁（题从《沅湘耆旧集》） · 隐山和尚","name":"留壁（题从《沅湘耆旧集》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三间茅屋从来住，一道神光万境闲。\n莫把事非来辨我，浮生穿凿不相关。\n（见《五灯会元》卷三、《石仓历代诗选》卷一一一、《沅湘耆旧集》卷十）（按：《沅湘耆旧集》另录一诗，爲大梅法常偈误入，见本书卷二十七。\n《正法眼藏》卷三作「洞山颂」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"隐山和尚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}